  "audit": {
    "toleranceMm": 0.12,
    "dimensionTargets": [
      "The default handle is a soft 38 mm triangular grip with 5.5 mm corner radii, gently bowed sides, and a 1.6 mm edge round-over.",
      "The default M8 path uses an 8.35 mm clearance bore plus a short 7.8 mm internal retention collar near the guard exit.",
      "The retention collar has a 1.2 mm contact band and 0.8 mm entry and release ramps so the knob presses onto threads without a sharp internal shoulder.",
      "The captive-nut pocket remains independently sized and opens on the flat print face."
    ],
    "invariants": [
      "Keep triangle span, corner radius, palm-side bow, handle height, and edge round-over independently editable.",
      "Keep spacer / guard base diameter, top diameter, and height independently editable so it may be straight or tapered.",
      "Keep bolt clearance, nut fit, and the retention collar independent; retention interference is measured against nominal bolt diameter, not the larger clearance bore.",
      "Preserve a closed one-piece shell with a downward-opening captive-nut pocket, a continuous bolt path, and a flat Z = 0 print face.",
      "Maintain the configured minimum handle, guard, and pocket-roof material around every opening.",
      "Treat the retention collar as a tunable friction detent, not a certified lock; print a fit coupon or one knob and test the actual bolt and filament before batching."
